The '''Rimma Trade Route''' was a [[super-hyperroute]] that crossed [[the galaxy]]. It notably passed through the [[planet]]s [[Eriadu]] and [[Sullust]], and intersected with the [[Hydian Way]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="EW Guide" />

==History==
Established [[5500 BBY|5,500 years]] before the [[Battle of Yavin]], the Rimma Trade Route was a [[super-hyperroute]] knitted together by smaller [[hyperspace route]]s. The trade route started at the [[planet]] [[Abregado-rae]] in the [[Core Worlds]], then weaving through the [[Colonies]], the [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]], the [[Expansion Region]] and the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] to the far reaches of the Outer Rim, ending at [[Kal'Shebbol]]. Rimma also took in the planets [[Sullust]], [[Eriadu]], and [[Dagobah]], and intersected with the [[Corellian Trade Spine]] and the [[Hydian Way]].<ref name="BMF 29">{{BuildFalconCite|29|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref>

